CI build failure in `examples/msw-react-crud` due to Tailwind CSS v4 breaking changes. The PostCSS plugin was extracted to a separate package and CSS directive syntax changed.

## Changes

- **PostCSS integration**: Added `@tailwindcss/postcss` package and updated `postcss.config.js` to use new plugin
- **CSS syntax migration**: Replaced v3 directives (`@tailwind base/components/utilities`) with v4 syntax (`@import "tailwindcss"`)
- **Style implementation**: Converted `@apply` directive usage to vanilla CSS within `@layer base` block
- **Vite configuration**: Added CommonJS transform options to handle workspace package bundling

## Example

```diff
- @tailwind base;
- @tailwind components;
- @tailwind utilities;
+ @import "tailwindcss";

- body {
-   @apply bg-background text-foreground antialiased font-sans;
- }
+ @layer base {
+   body {
+     background-color: var(--background);
+     color: var(--foreground);
+   }
+ }
```

Pattern follows existing `apps/docs` implementation already using Tailwind CSS v4.

